WEBVTT

asr-000005
00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:06.470
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Session is resumed. Majority Leader.

asr-000005-split-2
00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:16.580
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we consider the proposed budget of the Philippine Competition Commission.

asr-000005-split-3
00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:21.580
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Is there any objection? The Chair hears none. The motion is approved. Majority Leader.

asr-000005-split-4
00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:29.980
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Mr. Speaker, may we acknowledge the heads and the officials of the Philippine Competition Commission,

asr-000006
00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:44.600
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Chairperson Michael Aguinaldo, Commissioner Mara Victoria Querol, Commissioner Michael Peloton, Commissioner Lolibeth Medrano, Commissioner Ferdinand Negre. I so move, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000006-split-2
00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:59.680
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: To the heads of the Philippine Competition Commission headed by the Chairperson, the Honorable Michael G. Aguinaldo, welcome to the House of Representatives. Majority Leader.

asr-000007
00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:04.020
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we open the period of sponsorship and debate.

asr-000007-split-2
00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:09.540
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Is there any objection? The Chair hears none. The motion is approved. Majority Leader.

asr-000007-split-3
00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:25.750
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Dante Garcia, Vice Chair of the Committee on Appropriations, to sponsor the budget of the Philippine Competition Commission.

asr-000007-split-4
00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:29.980
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: The Honorable Dante Garcia is recognized. Please proceed.

asr-000008
00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:34.010
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the honorable...

asr-000009
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:44.520
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Mr. Speaker, to my esteemed colleague in the House of Representatives,

asr-000010
00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:55.780
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: I once again stand to sponsor the budget of an agency that is vital to the strength of our economy across various sectors,

asr-000011
00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:59.780
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: such as public procurement, telecommunications,

asr-000012
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.740
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: communications, and agriculture.

asr-000013
00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:09.940
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The Philippine Competition Commission, the PCC, implements the Philippine Competition Act

asr-000014
00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:14.860
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: by prohibiting anti-competitive agreements,

asr-000015
00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:22.160
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: abuse of dominant position, and anti-competitive mergers and acquisitions.

asr-000016
00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:29.160
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: This would turn, ensure that business compete and consumers benefit.

asr-000017
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:45.320
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Since we approved its budget in 2026, the PCC has ramped up its surveillance and investigative capabilities in procurement and bidding anomalies.

asr-000019
00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:51.360
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Scrutinize mergers and acquisitions that may harm markets.

asr-000020
00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:59.360
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Cast light on questionable business practices through economic research and increase...

asr-000022
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:08.300
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The business sector's understanding of competition law through advocacy and capacity-building activities.

asr-000024
00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:13.840
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: In terms of its surveillance and investigative mandate,

asr-000025
00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:21.760
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: the PCC has answered the nation's clamor to look into anomalous flood control projects.

asr-000026
00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:29.300
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The PCC has referred to the Department of Justice its initial findings involving...

asr-000029
00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:32.620
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: bidrigging in flood control projects in Bulacan.

asr-000030
00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:39.060
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Further, the PCC together with the NBI conducted a dawn raid

asr-000031
00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:43.920
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: covering premises associated with SunWest Incorporated,

asr-000032
00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:49.640
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Eco Leisure and Hospitality Holdings Company, Inc.,

asr-000033
00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:56.020
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: where the PCC and NBI reasonably suspect that relevant documentary

asr-000034
00:05:56.020 --> 00:06:00.620
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: and electronic records related to the ongoing investigation were located.

asr-000035
00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:07.580
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: This decisive action underscores PCC's commitment to ensuring that business

asr-000036
00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:12.200
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: operate within the bounds of the Philippine Competition Act.

asr-000037
00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:18.540
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: In addition, the PCC has fined the Boracay Business Administration

asr-000038
00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:25.020
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: of Scuba Shops and 40 of its member dive shops,

asr-000039
00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:26.000
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: total of

asr-000040
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:32.820
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: 2.17 million for engaging in price-fixing on Boracay Island.

asr-000041
00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:39.000
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Malay, Aklan, and directed BBASS and its member dive shops

asr-000042
00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:44.800
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: to cease and desist from enforcing the multi-year price-fixing agreement

asr-000043
00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.340
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: that harmed local tourism.

asr-000044
00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:53.120
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The PCC has likewise reviewed 21 mergers and acquisitions

asr-000045
00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:55.960
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: with the transaction value that approximately

asr-000046
00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:03.040
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: 515.6 billion pesos for any competition concerns

asr-000047
00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:06.300
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: for fiscal year 2026 to date.

asr-000048
00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.980
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Across sectors such as energy and financial services,

asr-000049
00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:15.080
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: the PCC together with the DICT and NTC

asr-000050
00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:19.460
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: likewise finalized the implementation of rules and regulations

asr-000051
00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.600
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: of the Konektadong Pinoy Act,

asr-000052
00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:25.960
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: which aims to foster competition among

asr-000053
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.740
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: data, transmission industry participants,

asr-000054
00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:31.840
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: and internet service providers.

asr-000055
00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:36.940
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Lastly, given the importance of awareness and competition laws

asr-000056
00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:39.880
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: by the private sector and its regulators,

asr-000057
00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:46.280
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: the PCC continues to conduct advocacy and capacity-building activities.

asr-000058
00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:52.520
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The PCC secured pledges from four of the biggest business organizations

asr-000059
00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:55.760
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: in the country, namely the Philippine Chamber of Commerce,

asr-000060
00:07:55.760 --> 00:08:11.900
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The Philippine Retailers Association, the Pharmaceutical and Healthcare Association of the Philippines, and the Financial Executive Institute of the Philippines to uphold the provisions of the Philippine Competition Act.

asr-000061
00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:28.320
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: With a budget of P587.6 million, the PCC was able to achieve the aforementioned initiatives, as I believe that the PCC can do more with more resources to help the government protect public funds.

asr-000062
00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:41.640
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: While the overall national budget for 2027 sees a 6% increase, our specific request for the PCC is calibrated to address the complex challenges,

asr-000063
00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:44.420
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: we face across various sectors.

asr-000064
00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:53.260
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: This budget will enable us to significantly ramp up our surveillance and investigative capabilities,

asr-000065
00:08:54.040 --> 00:09:04.280
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: allowing us to proactively detect and dismantle cartels, anti-competitive conduct, and bidrigging schemes that prey on each Filipino.

asr-000066
00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:10.300
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: This budget will be used to bolster our enforcement arm,

asr-000067
00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:11.900
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: enhance our data

asr-000068
00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:17.540
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: analytics capabilities to identify suspicious bidding patterns,

asr-000069
00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:24.080
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: and strengthen our collaboration with other oversight agencies.

asr-000070
00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:36.840
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: We are here to assure this Chamber that the PCC is fully committed to protect the public purse from the predatory practices of anti-competitive behavior.

asr-000071
00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.360
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: I urge my colleagues to support this budget.

asr-000072
00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:48.980
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: As it is about for fair markets, for fiscal responsibility, and for more competitive, prosperous Philippines.

asr-000073
00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:49.940
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Thank you.

asr-000074
00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.120
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Thank you, Honorable Garcia, Majority Leader.

asr-000075
00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:58.840
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Presley De Jesus for his interpellation.

asr-000076
00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:03.280
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: The Honorable Presley De Jesus of Party-list PHILRECA is recognized.

asr-000077
00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:04.160
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Please proceed.

asr-000078
00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:10.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, and to the distinguished sponsor, my idol.

asr-000079
00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Cong Dante Garcia.

asr-000080
00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:18.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My question is about the competition in Philippine renewable energy sector.

asr-000081
00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:24.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, good evening po sa atin lahat.

asr-000082
00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:30.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: PCC plays a crucial role in ensuring healthy competition in the energy sector.

asr-000083
00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:32.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So I will start.

asr-000084
00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:39.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is it true that the PCC had already conducted a competition impact assessment?

asr-000085
00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:46.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: of the Green Energy Auction Program, or GEAP, with the DOE and ERC?

asr-000086
00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:59.520
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Yes, the PCC conducted the study in 2025 and then conducted policy dialogue with the DOE and ERC last January and March of this year.

asr-000087
00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:10.140
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The study examined whether specific features of the program may create or facilitate anti-competitive effects.

asr-000088
00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:17.780
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: in the renewable energy sector, and identified policy options to address potential competition concerns,

asr-000089
00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:25.020
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: including the role of the PCC in coordination with the DOE, ERC, and other relevant bodies.

asr-000090
00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor.

asr-000091
00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:36.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My follow-up question is, is it also true that the group had identified competition concerns

asr-000092
00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:40.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: involving the geographic segmentation of the green energy sector?

asr-000094
00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:53.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the determination of Green Energy Auction Reserve, or GEAR, prices and the disclosure of price caps and conduct of pre-bid conferences, among others.

asr-000095
00:11:54.480 --> 00:12:01.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Can you share those competition concerns for the benefit of the body and the sector as a whole?

asr-000096
00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:10.260
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The PCC's role is to primarily assess the competition effects of GEAP

asr-000097
00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:15.480
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: within the existing framework and recommend pro-competitive reforms to the agencies concerned,

asr-000098
00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:18.140
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: namely DOE and ERC.

asr-000099
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.080
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: The study identified three potential competition concerns.

asr-000100
00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:27.900
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: First, the location-specific or per-grid auction design.

asr-000101
00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:35.060
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Second is the consistency and transparency of GEAR price determination

asr-000102
00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:40.160
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: and the disclosure of auction-related information, particularly GEAR prices,

asr-000104
00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:42.400
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: and the conduct

asr-000105
00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.660
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: of pre-bid conferences.

asr-000106
00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker,

asr-000107
00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:47.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-000108
00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My next follow-up question, Mr. Speaker,

asr-000109
00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Distinguished Sponsor, is this part

asr-000110
00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: of PCC's mandate to

asr-000111
00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:56.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: assess competition, risks,

asr-000112
00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:57.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and recommend reforms

asr-000113
00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:59.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: to maintain a healthy competitive

asr-000114
00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: industry? So, what concrete

asr-000115
00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: changes has the PCC

asr-000116
00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:06.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: recommended to the ERC

asr-000117
00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and DOE in making

asr-000118
00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:10.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the GEAP process more competitive?

asr-000119
00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.760
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: As mentioned earlier,

asr-000120
00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:15.940
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: the PCC provided

asr-000121
00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.000
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: policy recommendations were

asr-000122
00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.700
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: based on its assessment

asr-000123
00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:22.540
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: of GEAP 1 and GEAP 2

asr-000124
00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:23.680
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: through the CIA.

asr-000125
00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.360
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: Findings and recommendations

asr-000126
00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.220
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: were discussed with the

asr-000127
00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:29.840
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: DOE last January

asr-000128
00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:32.160
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: 2026, and

asr-000129
00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.260
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: ERC on March

asr-000130
00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:36.100
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: 2026, through

asr-000131
00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:37.980
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: policy dialogue including

asr-000132
