Rep. Dante S. Garcia: their possible application

asr-000133
00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.820
Rep. Dante S. Garcia: to future GIA programs.

asr-000134
00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you,

asr-000135
00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000136
00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Distinguished Sponsor. Now, I'm moving

asr-000137
00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: to another topic, the

asr-000138
00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: anti-competitive practices

asr-000139
00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:53.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: in fuel markets.

asr-000140
00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:54.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question,

asr-000141
00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:57.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: will still revolve around

asr-000142
00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: competition in the energy sector

asr-000143
00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: in April 2026?

asr-000144
00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:03.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Amid

asr-000145
00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:05.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: substantial fuel price pressures,

asr-000146
00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:07.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the PCC publicly

asr-000147
00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:09.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: stated that it was closely

asr-000148
00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: monitoring both the

asr-000149
00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: petroleum market and

asr-000150
00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:15.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: downstream markets for

asr-000151
00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: anti-competitive conduct.

asr-000152
00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:19.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: There are also calls from

asr-000153
00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:20.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: experts to examine

asr-000154
00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: possible cartel-like behavior

asr-000155
00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:25.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and improve coordination

asr-000156
00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: in enforcing

asr-000157
00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: competition rules.

asr-000158
00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My question to the good sponsor,

asr-000159
00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000160
00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: is this has the PCC

asr-000161
00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: move beyond

asr-000162
00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:39.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: monitoring and actually

asr-000163
00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: commence a formal investigation

asr-000164
