asr-001013
01:06:21.460 --> 01:06:28.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yeah, Mr. Speaker. For the information of everyone, GOCC stands for government-owned controlled corporation.

asr-001014
01:06:28.440 --> 01:06:46.020
