asr-001019
01:07:05.680 --> 01:07:18.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, based on the charter of the GCG and all of its guidelines, there are six qualifications for the recommendation of this positive action.

asr-001020
01:07:20.120 --> 01:07:26.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: One, the GOCC's function is no longer relevant to state or national development policy.

asr-001021
01:07:27.520 --> 01:07:28.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Second, it...

asr-001022
01:07:28.440 --> 01:07:33.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's duplicate or unnecessarily overlaps with other government agencies.

asr-001023
01:07:33.300 --> 01:07:40.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The third one, the GOCC is not producing desired outcomes or is no longer achieving its objectives, as stated.

asr-001024
01:07:40.980 --> 01:07:45.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The fourth would be, the GOCC would be dormant or non-operational.

asr-001025
01:07:46.420 --> 01:07:57.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The fifth would be, the GOCC would be involved in activities that is determined to be best carried out by a private sector firm.

asr-001026
01:07:58.440 --> 01:08:04.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And the sixth one would be, the GOCC's nature of operations would require consolidation under a holding company.

asr-001027
01:08:05.480 --> 01:08:09.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, those are the six qualifications for recommendation for abolition, Mr. Speaker.

