asr-001440
01:27:05.160 --> 01:27:05.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: highly skilled.

asr-001441
01:27:06.800 --> 01:27:07.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, kung baga,

asr-001442
01:27:07.300 --> 01:27:09.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: insentibo ito para manatili sila

asr-001443
01:27:09.140 --> 01:27:11.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa mga government financial institutions,

asr-001444
01:27:12.040 --> 01:27:13.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kasi kung pangit naman

asr-001445
01:27:13.340 --> 01:27:15.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung package na inooffer ng mga

asr-001446
01:27:15.080 --> 01:27:16.380
