Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Proposal to the Department of State of the United States of America on the establishment of a Paxilica Coordination Office

asr-003873
04:37:55.880 --> 04:38:04.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in an area of approximately 4,000 acres strategically located in the Luzon Economic Corridor.

asr-003874
04:38:05.380 --> 04:38:08.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang offer nyo po, magtatayo ng Paxilica Coordination Office.

asr-003875
04:38:09.660 --> 04:38:10.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po?

asr-003876
04:38:10.940 --> 04:38:11.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, sabi dito,

asr-003877
04:38:11.960 --> 04:38:12.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: so,

asr-003878
04:38:12.080 --> 04:38:16.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ano ang gagawin?

asr-003879
04:38:16.460 --> 04:38:19.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano itong Paxilica Coordination Office?

asr-003880
04:38:20.620 --> 04:38:28.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It will serve as a principal bilateral facility to undertake the following functions.

asr-003881
04:38:29.800 --> 04:38:36.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: One, coordination of critical mineral supply chain security initiatives between the two nations.

asr-003882
04:38:37.300 --> 04:38:41.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Facilitation of joint strategic industrial planning and infrastructure development

asr-003883
04:38:41.840 --> 04:38:46.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: within the Luzon Economic Corridor.

asr-003884
04:38:46.460 --> 04:38:53.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Number four, coordination of allied investment and private capital mobilization for economic security projects.

asr-003885
04:38:53.840 --> 04:39:01.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Number four, support for workforce development, technology transfer, and capacity building activities

asr-003886
04:39:01.300 --> 04:39:06.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: aligned with bilateral economic security objectives and five such other activities

asr-003887
04:39:06.480 --> 04:39:13.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: as the two governments may mutually determine to be consistent with the purposes of the coordination office.

asr-003888
04:39:13.220 --> 04:39:15.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, magtatayo po ng opisina.

asr-003889
04:39:15.360 --> 04:39:16.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po?

asr-003890
04:39:17.900 --> 04:39:20.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At, ito may mga functions nga,

asr-003891
04:39:20.780 --> 04:39:22.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: koordinative functions.

asr-003892
04:39:22.860 --> 04:39:26.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, pwede po bang mag-elaborate lang dahil hindi natin makuha

asr-003893
04:39:26.580 --> 04:39:30.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: based on a reading of the letter.

asr-003894
