asr-005245
05:50:17.600 --> 05:50:24.200
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: There's a joint motion to terminate the interpellations on the proposed budget of Subic Bay Metropolitan Authority.

asr-005246
05:50:24.320 --> 05:50:24.940
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Do we hear any objections?

asr-005248
05:50:26.400 --> 05:50:31.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Hearing none, the period of interpellation on the proposed budget of SPMA is hereby terminated.

asr-005249
05:50:32.360 --> 05:50:33.240
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

