asr-005252
05:50:46.480 --> 05:50:51.680
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: There is a motion to consider the proposed budget of the Department of Science and Technology,

asr-005253
05:50:51.840 --> 05:50:53.180
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: including its attached agencies.

asr-005254
05:50:53.180 --> 05:50:54.700
